(7687065, 1258885, 65234, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to figure out the anagram was "cedar." I was thinking it was the whole title and was quite stumped. Very pretty bird. The eye area looks very dark on my screen.</td>', 'Took me a minute to figure out the anagram was "cedar." I was thinking it was the whole title and was quite stumped. Very pretty bird. The eye area looks very dark on my screen.', '2021-02-15 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
