(7687189, 1258852, 143116, '<td valign="top">There is a haze of unsharpness in this photograph. I had a similar issue, and I was able to solve it by applying "sharpening" upon exporting for DPC. If you just use a bi-cubic interpolation algorithm it is just not tack sharp, with bi-cubic plus sharpening it is a lot better. Maybe this helps you too.</td>', 'There is a haze of unsharpness in this photograph. I had a similar issue, and I was able to solve it by applying "sharpening" upon exporting for DPC. If you just use a bi-cubic interpolation algorithm it is just not tack sharp, with bi-cubic plus sharpening it is a lot better. Maybe this helps you too.', '2021-02-15 23:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687190, 1258933, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like how you have two anagrams in a single picture. I also like the general composition, but I struggle with the choice of focus and the fact that it seems to be nowhere tack sharp.</td>', 'I like how you have two anagrams in a single picture. I also like the general composition, but I struggle with the choice of focus and the fact that it seems to be nowhere tack sharp.', '2021-02-15 23:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
